nd  we're sure that after a while our  decision will begin to make sense to you  and finally we want to be more open and  communicative with you our wonderful  audience  but whilst our team is mighty it's also  pretty small meaning that sometimes we  just can't reply to all your comments  and great ideas about our videos and  channel  therefore we've decided to turn to you  guys to seek volunteers who would like  to join our friendly team here at sumsub  if you've been dreaming of joining our  team for a long time then head over to  our community posts and look for the  requirements for joining the ranks of  our Jedis of the online jungle  Well for now that's all the news we have  to give to you  we at the sunsup team believe that  openness and honesty are the most  powerful keys to people's hearts and  hope that with this video we've brought  more clarity about the future of the  channel  we can't wait to start this journey with  you guys see you very soon cheers
 

